{%- comment -%}
  Baci Milano USA — Draft order invoice notification.
  Paste into: Shopify admin → Settings → Notifications → Customer notifications →
  "Draft order invoice" → Edit code (replace the whole body).

  ⚠ SCOPED BY TAG — READ THIS FIRST.
  Shopify has ONE draft-order-invoice template for the whole store, so this file guards on the
  `b2b-app` tag that the rep app stamps on every draft it creates (server/src/orders.js).
    • Draft created by the app  (tagged b2b-app) → the branded wholesale quote below.
    • Any other draft (retail drafts you build by hand in Shopify admin, etc.)
                                → falls through to YOUR EXISTING TEMPLATE, untouched.

  SO BEFORE YOU PASTE: open the current "Draft order invoice" template, select ALL of it, and
  copy it. Then paste this file in its place and drop what you copied into the marked
  "RETAIL / NON-APP DRAFTS" block near the bottom. That block is what retail quotes keep using.
  (Shopify's editor also has "Revert to default" if you ever need the stock code back.)

  Matches the app's printed order copy (web/src/components/PrintDocs.jsx OrderCopyDoc):
  blue band + white logo, PREPARED FOR block, line thumbnails, MSRP/Unit/Total,
  ready-vs-backorder framing, DUE TODAY + deposit breakdown, notes, T&C, footer.

  Notification templates expose draft-order properties UNPREFIXED ({{ name }}, not
  {{ order.name }}). Everything below degrades gracefully if a field is absent.

  The app splits a cart into up to TWO drafts, so each invoice covers one of them.
  Which one is read off the tags the app stamps:
    ready-to-ship | backorder + deposit-required + deposit-pct:<n>
  and the deposit figures come from the custom attributes the app writes.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- comment -%} Only app-created wholesale drafts get the branded quote. {%- endcomment -%}
{%- if tags contains 'b2b-app' -%}

{%- assign is_backorder = false -%}
{%- if tags contains 'backorder' -%}{%- assign is_backorder = true -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- assign lead_time = '6–10 weeks' -%}
{%- comment -%}
  Quote validity: 7 days from when the draft was created. The unix-seconds round trip
  (date:"%s" → plus → date) is the standard Liquid way to do date math; 604800 = 7 days.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign valid_through = created_at | date: "%s" | plus: 604800 | date: "%B %-d, %Y" -%}
{%- assign deposit_required = attributes["Deposit required"] -%}
{%- assign balance_due = attributes["Balance due at fulfillment"] -%}
{%- assign customer_tier = attributes["Customer tier"] -%}
{%- assign sales_rep = attributes["Sales rep"] -%}

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>{{ shop.name }} — Order {{ name }}</title>
  </head>
  <body style="margin:0; padding:0; background:#f4f4f5;">
    <!-- Preheader: shows in the inbox preview, hidden in the body -->
    <div style="display:none; max-height:0; overflow:hidden; opacity:0;">
      Your quoted order {{ name }} — valid through {{ valid_through }}.{% if is_backorder %} Deposit due to secure your backordered pieces.{% endif %}
    </div>

    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background:#f4f4f5;">
      <tr>
        <td align="center" style="padding:24px 12px;">
          <table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:600px; max-width:100%; background:#ffffff;">

            <!-- Blue band + white logo -->
            <tr>
              <td align="center" style="background:#2B1AFE; padding:28px 24px;">
                <img src="https://bacimilanousa.com/cdn/shop/files/Baci_Logo_-_White.png?height=108"
                     alt="Baci Milano" height="36"
                     style="display:block; border:0; height:36px; width:auto;" />
                <div style="margin-top:14px; color:#ffffff; font-family:Inter,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:11px; letter-spacing:.2em; text-transform:uppercase; font-weight:600; line-height:1.5;">
                  Quoted Order — Valid Through {{ valid_through }}
                </div>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Meta + PREPARED FOR -->
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:26px 24px 0; font-family:Inter,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; color:#141414;">
                <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                  <tr>
                    <td valign="top" style="font-size:13px; color:#6b6b70; line-height:1.6;">
                      {{ created_at | date: "%B %d, %Y" }}<br />
                      Order ref: <strong style="color:#141414;">{{ name }}</strong>
                      {% if is_backorder %}(backorder){% else %}(ready to ship){% endif %}
                      {% if sales_rep %}<br />Sales rep: {{ sales_rep }}{% endif %}
                    </td>
                    <td valign="top" align="right" style="font-size:13px; line-height:1.6;">
                      <div style="font-size:10px; letter-spacing:.18em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#6b6b70; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:4px;">Prepared for</div>
                      {% if billing_address.company %}{{ billing_address.company }}<br />{% endif %}
                      {% if billing_address.name %}{{ billing_address.name }}<br />{% endif %}
                      {% if email %}{{ email }}<br />{% endif %}
                      {% if billing_address.phone %}{{ billing_address.phone }}{% endif %}
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
              </td>
            </tr>

            {% if custom_message %}
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:20px 24px 0; font-family:Inter,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#141414;">
                {{ custom_message }}
              </td>
            </tr>
            {% endif %}

            <!-- Section head -->
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:26px 24px 0; font-family:Inter,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
                <div style="border-bottom:2px solid #141414; padding-bottom:8px; font-size:15px; font-weight:700;">
                  {% if is_backorder %}Backorder — ships in approx. {{ lead_time }}{% else %}Ready to ship{% endif %}
                </div>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Line items: thumbnail, title/SKU, MSRP, unit, total -->
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:0 24px; font-family:Inter,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
                <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="font-size:13px;">
                  {% for line in line_items %}
                  <tr>
                    <td width="56" valign="top" style="padding:14px 10px 14px 0;">
                      {%- comment -%}
                        image_url is the CURRENT filter (img_url is deprecated); it applies
                        directly to a line_item and REQUIRES a width or height. 120px = 2x the
                        52px display box, so it stays crisp on retina.
                        If thumbnails ever come through blank on a test send, the legacy form
                        {{ line | img_url: 'compact' }} is the fallback.
                      {%- endcomment -%}
                      {% if line.image %}
                        <img src="{{ line | image_url: width: 120 }}" alt="" width="52" height="52"
                             style="display:block; border:0; width:52px; height:52px; background:#f4f4f5;" />
                      {% endif %}
                    </td>
                    <td valign="top" style="padding:14px 8px 14px 0; line-height:1.5;">
                      <div style="font-weight:600; color:#141414;">{{ line.title }}</div>
                      <div style="color:#6b6b70; font-size:12px;">
                        {% if line.sku %}{{ line.sku }}{% elsif line.variant.sku %}{{ line.variant.sku }}{% endif %}
                        &nbsp;·&nbsp; Qty {{ line.quantity }}
                      </div>
                    </td>
                    <td valign="top" align="right" style="padding:14px 0; white-space:nowrap; line-height:1.5;">
                      {% if line.original_price and line.original_price > line.price %}
                        <div style="color:#6b6b70; font-size:11px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.04em;">
                          MSRP {{ line.original_price | money }}
                        </div>
                      {% endif %}
                      <div style="color:#6b6b70; font-size:12px;">{{ line.price | money }} ea</div>
                      <div style="font-weight:700; color:#141414;">{{ line.line_price | money }}</div>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr><td colspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid #e6e6e8; font-size:0; line-height:0;">&nbsp;</td></tr>
                  {% endfor %}
                </table>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Totals -->
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:18px 24px 0; font-family:Inter,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
                <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="font-size:14px;">
                  <tr>
                    <td style="padding:4px 0; color:#6b6b70;">Subtotal</td>
                    <td align="right" style="padding:4px 0; font-weight:600;">{{ subtotal_price | money }}</td>
                  </tr>
                  {% if shipping_price and shipping_price > 0 %}
                  <tr>
                    <td style="padding:4px 0; color:#6b6b70;">Shipping</td>
                    <td align="right" style="padding:4px 0;">{{ shipping_price | money }}</td>
                  </tr>
                  {% endif %}
                  {% if tax_price and tax_price > 0 %}
                  <tr>
                    <td style="padding:4px 0; color:#6b6b70;">Tax</td>
                    <td align="right" style="padding:4px 0;">{{ tax_price | money }}</td>
                  </tr>
                  {% endif %}
                  <tr>
                    <td style="padding:10px 0 0; border-top:1px solid #e6e6e8; font-weight:700; font-size:15px;">Total</td>
                    <td align="right" style="padding:10px 0 0; border-top:1px solid #e6e6e8; font-weight:700; font-size:15px;">{{ total_price | money }}</td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
              </td>
            </tr>

            {% if is_backorder and deposit_required %}
            <!-- Deposit breakdown (backorder drafts only) -->
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:18px 24px 0; font-family:Inter,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
                <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background:#f2f1ff; font-size:14px;">
                  <tr>
                    <td style="padding:14px 16px 4px; color:#2B1AFE; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.06em; font-size:12px; text-transform:uppercase;">Due today</td>
                    <td align="right" style="padding:14px 16px 4px; color:#2B1AFE; font-weight:800; font-size:16px;">{{ deposit_required }}</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td colspan="2" style="padding:0 16px 6px; color:#6b6b70; font-size:12px; line-height:1.6;">
                      Deposit securing your backordered pieces{% if customer_tier %} · {{ customer_tier }}{% endif %}.
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                  {% if balance_due %}
                  <tr>
                    <td style="padding:0 16px 14px; color:#141414; font-size:13px;">Due before shipment (balance)</td>
                    <td align="right" style="padding:0 16px 14px; color:#141414; font-size:13px; font-weight:700;">{{ balance_due }}</td>
                  </tr>
                  {% endif %}
                </table>
              </td>
            </tr>
            {% endif %}

            <!-- Pay button -->
            <tr>
              <td align="center" style="padding:26px 24px 0;">
                <a href="{{ invoice_url }}"
                   style="display:inline-block; background:#2B1AFE; color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none;
                          font-family:Inter,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;
                          font-size:13px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.16em; text-transform:uppercase;
                          padding:16px 40px;">
                  {% if is_backorder %}Pay deposit{% else %}Pay invoice{% endif %}
                </a>
                <div style="margin-top:10px; font-family:Inter,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:11px; color:#6b6b70;">
                  Secure checkout powered by Shopify
                </div>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Ship to -->
            {% if shipping_address %}
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:26px 24px 0; font-family:Inter,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
                <div style="font-size:10px; letter-spacing:.18em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#6b6b70; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:6px;">Ship to</div>
                <div style="font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; color:#141414;">
                  {{ shipping_address.name }}<br />
                  {% if shipping_address.company %}{{ shipping_address.company }}<br />{% endif %}
                  {{ shipping_address.address1 }}<br />
                  {% if shipping_address.address2 != blank %}{{ shipping_address.address2 }}<br />{% endif %}
                  {{ shipping_address.city }}{% if shipping_address.province_code %}, {{ shipping_address.province_code }}{% endif %} {{ shipping_address.zip }}<br />
                  {{ shipping_address.country }}
                </div>
              </td>
            </tr>
            {% endif %}

            {% if note != blank %}
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:22px 24px 0; font-family:Inter,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
                <div style="font-size:10px; letter-spacing:.18em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#6b6b70; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:6px;">Notes</div>
                <div style="font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; color:#141414; white-space:pre-line;">{{ note }}</div>
              </td>
            </tr>
            {% endif %}

            <!-- Terms & conditions (mirrors quoteTerms() in the app) -->
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:24px 24px 0; font-family:Inter,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
                <div style="font-size:10px; letter-spacing:.18em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#6b6b70; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:8px;">Terms &amp; conditions</div>
                <ul style="margin:0; padding-left:18px; font-size:11px; line-height:1.75; color:#6b6b70;">
                  <li>Prices are wholesale, quoted in U.S. dollars, and EXCLUDE freight/shipping, insurance, duties, and any applicable state or local taxes unless expressly stated on this document.</li>
                  <li>This quoted order is valid through {{ valid_through }}. All items are subject to prior sale and to availability at time of order confirmation.</li>
                  <li>In-stock (&ldquo;ready to ship&rdquo;) items typically ship within 3&ndash;5 business days of cleared payment.</li>
                  <li>Backordered items typically ship in {{ lead_time }} from order confirmation; any ship/arrival dates shown are good-faith estimates and may change.</li>
                  <li>Backorder deposits are applied to the balance due at fulfillment; the remaining balance is due before the backordered goods ship.</li>
                </ul>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Footer -->
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:24px; font-family:Inter,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
                <div style="border-top:1px solid #e6e6e8; padding-top:16px; font-size:11px; line-height:1.7; color:#6b6b70; text-align:center;">
                  Questions or changes — your Baci Milano sales rep<br />
                  305.600.0099 · <a href="mailto:GS@BaciMilanoUSA.com" style="color:#2B1AFE; text-decoration:none;">GS@BaciMilanoUSA.com</a><br />
                  Baci Milano USA, LLC · 1835 E Hallandale Beach Blvd STE 834, Hallandale Beach, FL 33009
                </div>
              </td>
            </tr>

          </table>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>

{%- else -%}
{%- comment -%}
  ============================================================================
  RETAIL / NON-APP DRAFTS  —  PASTE YOUR EXISTING TEMPLATE BETWEEN THESE LINES
  ============================================================================
  Any draft order NOT created by the rep app (no `b2b-app` tag) renders here —
  e.g. retail-priced drafts you build by hand in Shopify admin. Paste the code
  you copied from the current "Draft order invoice" template here, exactly as
  it was, so those quotes keep going out unchanged.

  Leaving this block empty would send a BLANK email for retail drafts, so don't
  install this template until you've pasted your existing code in.
  ============================================================================
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- endif -%}
